Gentlemen,
Since Prescott Pines is not going to work out for 2027 Conclave, I have
gotten a quote from Chapel Rock in Prescott which look great.

https://chapelrock.net/

The room accomodations are hotel style with two beds per room  and there is
a grat looking lodge for us to hold our indoor events (Newell Center)

I am in the process of looking into activities.

The cost is very reasonable.

Please look at the website and let me know your thoughts.

The dates I am looking at are July16 through the 18th.

Dad Johnston

